# Google Cloud key with the Map Tiles API enabled
# https://developers.google.com/maps/documentation/tile/3d-tiles
GOOGLE_TILES_API_KEY="your-google-tiles-api-key"
VITE_GOOGLE_TILES_API_KEY=${GOOGLE_TILES_API_KEY}

# Or: the same Google 3D tiles through Cesium ion, no Google billing needed.
# Free token at https://ion.cesium.com/tokens. When set, it is used instead.
CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=""
VITE_CESIUM_ION_TOKEN=${CESIUM_ION_TOKEN}

# Teacher model (Gemini 3 Pro Image). Either Google directly (needs billing):
GEMINI_API_KEY=""
# or the same model through OpenRouter (prepaid credits, no Google billing):
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=""

# Tile hosting on Backblaze B2 (see docs/HANDOFF.md). Locally: a Read and
# Write key for uploading with rclone. On Vercel: a Read Only key, which
# site/api/tile-token.js uses to mint download tokens for the private bucket.
B2_KEY_ID=""
B2_APPLICATION_KEY=""
B2_BUCKET="Tinyblr"
